=== 
--- calls
exit: 0
--- stdout
erstebank_at — host wrapper

Read-only collector for George, the retail e-banking portal of Erste Bank
und Sparkassen in Austria (george.sparkasse.at): checking accounts
(Girokonto) and credit cards, their transaction history, and statement
PDFs.

Subcommands:
  build               Build the Docker image (`docker build`).
  download [args...]  One-shot sign-in + REST fetch of the checking accounts
                      and credit cards (history + statement PDFs) into a
                      UTC-stamped bronze run dir. The push is approved in
                      the George app — no VNC, nothing to type. --lookback
                      bounds the window; --no-documents skips the PDFs;
                      --dry-run reads the rosters only. It signs in like a
                      run, so it fires a push when no session is alive.
  login [args...]     Folds into download, which signs in only without a
                      live session. `login --check` reports whether a
                      session is alive (exit 0 alive, 1 none, 3 no
                      verdict; no push).
  vnc-login [args...] Fallback for download: expose VNC and do the sign-in
                      by hand, then fetch.
  load [args...]      Ingest bronze into the SQLite silver (accounts,
                      transactions, daily closing balances, statements).
                      --force rebuilds from all bronze.
  explore [args...]   Discovery harness: Camoufox over VNC + HAR / network
                      log / click log / DOM snapshots / response bodies
                      under /debug. Sign-in and the push approval are
                      done by hand.
  prune [args...]     Delete non-complete dumps from the bronze tree, and
                      aged entries of the /debug cache (runs host-side).
                      --dry-run prints the plan.
  sh|bash             Open an interactive shell in the container.
  help                Show this message.

Mounted into the container:
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/home/.secrets  ->  /secrets
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/xdgdata/wealthdb/erstebank_at     ->  /data
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/xdgcache/wealthdb/startupcache  ->  /cache/startupcache
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/xdgcache/wealthdb/erstebank_at  ->  /cache/collector
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/xdgcache/wealthdb/debug/erstebank_at    ->  /debug
  <TMP>/w-erstebank_at/tree/collectors/erstebank_at  ->  /app

Override mounts via env:
  ERSTEBANK_AT_SECRETS_DIR=/path/to/secrets
  ERSTEBANK_AT_DATA_DIR=/path/to/data
  ERSTEBANK_AT_DEBUG_DIR=/path/to/debug

Credentials (read from /secrets/erstebank_at.env inside the container
= $HOME/.secrets/erstebank_at.env on the host; chmod 0600):
  ERSTEBANK_AT_USERNAME   the George user name (Verfügernummer or alias)
  The sign-in is confirmed in the George app.
